SUMMARY
Your expertise is urgently needed for a critical task. The Square has recently uncovered a sophisticated malware sample targeting U.S. service members. This malware is being distributed through phishing emails disguised as communications from healthcare providers.
Our intelligence has indicated that Empire Health's network is the next probable target. As a representative of KCHQ, you are tasked with identifying and neutralizing this phishing attempt, as well as uncovering the perpetrators.
Empire Health is one of the largest healthcare networks in the country and healthcare is routinely targeted in cyber-space. The Square has specifically asked for your support for this urgent task.

SOURCE
https://kc7cyber.com/challenges/909

